; PTRS P_8, the union of P_8^(1) and P_8^(2) (J.-C. Kassing, dissertation, RWTH Aachen University, Chapter 5)

(format PTRS)

(fun f 2)
(fun s 1)
(fun a 0)
(fun |0| 0)
(fun g 1)

(prule (f (s x) y) (((f x y) :prob 1 )))
(prule (f x (s y)) (((f x y) :prob 1 )))
(prule a ((|0| :prob 1 ) ((s a) :prob 1 )))
(prule (g x) ((x :prob 1 )))
